  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN-IPR Programme on Women in Peace Processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to gather evidence of women&#x2019;s participation and contribution in past peace processes in the ASEAN region as a point of reference for policymakers, researchers and scholars working on initiatives related women, peace and security. Moreover, these efforts are also to create basis for inclusive policy for women&#x2019;s participation in conflict resolution. The project will also offer capacity building activities to empower present activists and women mediators in the region, a data base of women peace actors, and organise a regional conference.</narrative>
  </description>
